  "body": "Discover this stunning House & Land Package by Generation Homes in the fast-growing Ara Hills development.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of Orewa and conveniently accessed via the first left turn from the Orewa Motorway off-ramp, Ara Hills offers the perfect balance of bush and beach living. This thoughtfully master-planned community combines breathtaking natural surroundings with a welcoming village atmosphere. \r\n\r\nEnjoy a connected community, and the unique lifestyle that Ara Hills has to offer, all just minutes from Orewa Beach, local amenities, and transport links.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully designed 161.61m² home is set on a picturesque 325m² section with tranquil native bush views.\r\n\r\nHome Features\r\n- 161.61m² floor area\r\n- 3 bedrooms\r\n- 2 full modern bathrooms\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area\r\n- Full kitchen with walk-in pantry\r\n- Separate lounge\r\n- Dedicated study\r\n- Double garage with designated laundry space for, super tub, washer and dryer\r\n- Outdoor deck flowing seamlessly from the lounge\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern living in mind, this practical and stylish home makes the most of a compact footprint while providing all the comforts and functionality you need. Ideal for couples looking to downsize, establish a long-term retirement home, or young families seeking a practical layout, this thoughtfully designed home offers low-maintenance living without compromising on functionality, comfort, or style.\r\n\r\nStep inside and be welcomed by the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area. The galley-style kitchen is both functional and elegant, featuring a discreetly tucked-away walk-in pantry for added storage and organisation. A separate lounge at the rear of the home provides a quiet retreat and opens directly onto the outdoor decking area, creating the perfect space for entertaining guests or enjoying a summer BBQ.\r\n\r\nA central hallway leads to three generously sized bedrooms, each complete with built-in wardrobes. The master suite enjoys the added luxury of a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite. The remaining two bedrooms are serviced by a well-appointed family bathroom, conveniently located opposite a fitted study nook that is perfect for working from home, studying, or managing household tasks.\r\n\r\nThe double garage incorporates a practical laundry area with space for a washer, dryer, and laundry tub, while also providing easy internal access to the home, making grocery unloading and everyday living effortless.\r\n\r\nAssuring you we provide fixed-price contracts and a guaranteed completion date, giving you certainty and peace of mind. Since 1997, we’ve successfully completed over 6,800 homes on time and within budget across New Zealand.\r\n\r\n*Images are from a previous Show Home to show our build quality.\r\n\r\n*Project budget based on assumed specification, final pricing is subject to purchaser requirements.\r\n\r\nContact Norman or Nadine to secure this House and Land Package today!",
